WEBVTT

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:35.050
There's no girl as wonderful as you in the whole wide world.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:38.300
I'd never let you go, even if you killed me.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:43.520
And you're the kind of girl who can't live without a man,

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.980
no matter how high-class you may wish you were.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.070
You're my girl.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.480
Don't forget that.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.900
Are you Golgo 13?

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.280
Thanks for the ticket.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.820
Thanks for coming.

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:39.280
Leave alone after the first act.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.280
There's not much time.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.110
I'm surprised you made it here before me.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:17.860
So, how'd you get the key?

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:24.870
Do you think there's a bug hidden around here or something?

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.910
I just received an opera ticket all of a sudden.

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:30.920
I've got no guarantee you aren't an enemy.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:35.550
Don't stand behind me.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:09.830
Let's hear it.

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.340
Do you know Marty O'Brien?

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.100
He's the man behind all the gambling rings in this city.

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.100
To put it simply...

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:32.310
I want you to kill him!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:34.810
Why?

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:36.980
It's simple.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.070
I don't want to be with him anymore.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.160
I didn't start being with him because I wanted to.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:47.830
It was simple for him to deceive a poor country girl who'd just come to the city.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:55.000
Before I knew it, I was the woman of a Mafia boss.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:00.550
I tried to get away many times, but he wouldn't let me go.

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:04.300
I've got five or ten years of youth left.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.100
It'll be too late once they're gone.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:13.810
Once you've killed Marty, I'm going to Florida.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:19.190
I've been stealing part of Marty's earnings for the past six years, so I've got plenty of money.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.990
I'll start over again in Florida.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:25.070
Please, save me from Marty!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.740
You're the only one who can!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:51.270
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:04:53.100 --> 00:05:02.610
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:14.370
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:20.670
The weak person I was is no more

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:26.260
I decided to just believe

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:33.390
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:37.230
I go towards you

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:44.940
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:49.070
I go towards you

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:53.120
Blown by the wind

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:58.580
Oh blown

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:04.630
Pretty Woman

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.510
Ricky...

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.230
Hey.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.230
What are you doing, you asshole?

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:30.410
I bet not a single man talked to you, Linda.

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.950
Marty's a jealous guy, after all.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:36.910
If he knew a man was talking to you, they'd be dead.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.250
Then you'll be dead soon.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:45.000
I'm only hitting on you 'cause you're worth it, pretty woman.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.550
I'm sick of Mafia men.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.760
That's pretty funny,

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:55.470
since if Marty hadn't picked you up, you'd still be on Park Avenue looking for customers.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.130
You're getting wet, aren't you?

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:28.090
Not in public. Stop it, Marty.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.260
No matter how much of a high-society girl you pretend to be, your body can't fool me.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.060
Oh, Billy?

00:07:39.060 --> 00:07:40.230
Wait a second.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:48.440
You hate him for this, don't you, Linda?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:54.700
He's getting old. I could make you happy in a more direct way, not like this.

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.620
I'm not into you.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.450
I've told you, I'm sick of Mafia men.

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:03.790
The Mafia runs all the prostitution in this city.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:08.340
You girls can't live without us.

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:12.340
I'm sure of it, boss.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.090
Linda rented a room under a fake name.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.850
Was it Ricky after all, then?

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.470
I don't know.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.980
There's no proof that anything happened here. It's strange.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.350
I'll put some pressure on Ricky.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:45.790
His draw speed is on par with mine.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.970
Marty's right hand man, Billy, is great with a gun.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:09:00.970
Marty almost never leaves his penthouse for fear of his enemies.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.640
The windows are made of special bulletproof glass,

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.940
and his limousine has been customized to be as strong as a tank.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.040
He's no ordinary man.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:35.260
You've gotta be kidding me!
I never went to Central Hotel with Linda!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.720
Well, Linda?

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:43.270
The imprint of the words "Central Hotel 1204" were found on the memo pad in your room.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.770
This is your handwriting.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.770
I-I'm sorry...

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.860
It was with Ricky, wasn't it?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.610
I'm sure you wouldn't forgive me even if I begged...

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.950
What are you talking about?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.950
Don't beg for your life, it's pathetic.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.580
S-Stop it!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.580
Hey, listen to me!

00:10:11.090 --> 00:10:12.550
Linda!

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:13.920
You bitch!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.900
He must've been blown off by the wind.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:35.230
You'll deal with this one too, won't you, Detective Scott?

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:39.030
My wife's telling me she wants to go to Europe for her summer vacation.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.160
How does Paris sound?

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.450
Thanks.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:42.160
Understood.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.160
Get out of the way!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:48.160
Boss!

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.590
Damn! What's going on?

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:54.300
D-Damn!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.390
I don't like this, Marty.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:14.980
If your men are with me, I may as well hang a sign around my neck reading "Mafia Wife."

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.110
Wait, Linda.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.650
Listen to me, Linda.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:27.410
If somebody were to kidnap you and demand all my territory from me, I'd give it to them.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.120
You understand, right?

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:34.630
If I'm that much of a burden, just get rid of me!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:53.600
This is good too.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:59.940
A bit more, and I'll live a life where these clothes are perfect for me.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:03.820
He's going to take me away from this city.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.790
Hey, would you pull down the zipper on my back?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.130
Yes.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.340
Thanks.

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.380
You can leave.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.590
No, we were told to stay by you.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:30.060
You know, I might decide to scream right now,
and tell everyone how you were about to jump me.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:32.810
We'll be right outside!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:47.620
Please leave a message.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.330
It's Linda.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.200
Why don't you come to Florida with me?

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:55.540
If you want, I can put another villa up for you next to mine.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:56.330
I'll be waiting for your call.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.260
You're going to kill him?

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:13.270
It's about time Marty retired.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:18.230
And so we'll take the cut of the gambling that he's getting?

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.770
Yeah, that was the Boss's dream.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:25.150
We'll get revenge for him.

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.530
Just you wait, Marty.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.400
We got the video from the security camera.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.620
The footage isn't great, but take a look.

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:25.760
The second one on the right from the front is 1204.

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:34.470
I know that man...

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.190
He's the one...

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.730
You know him?

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:45.860
No.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.950
All we can tell from this footage is that he's Asian, but...

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:51.700
You know who he is?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.700
Do you know a man named Golgo 13?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.960
The assassin.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:02.670
We've received information that he's come to Manhattan.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:06.960
For someone like him, every move he makes is useful information.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:15.180
From the look of his face and his figure, I think it's pretty certain.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.230
I'll pay you double the usual rate.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:24.270
Find out where he lives.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:28.070
This isn't a good idea this time, Billy.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.320
It's dangerous to fuck with Golgo.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:34.280
I'm told he never shows anyone his back.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.370
I'll be the one to see it...

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:40.290
when it's covered in blood!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.290
What?

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.090
Linda was sleeping with Golgo?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.090
No, I don't think she was cheating on you.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:52.930
Impossible. You're saying she hired him to kill me?

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.850
It's quite possible.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.180
Damn!

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:06.400
I raise a prostitute from the country into a lady, and this is the thanks I get?

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.490
What will we do?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.450
Don't say anything to Linda, please.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.260
Why won't you pick up?

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.430
Who are you calling?

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:44.650
I was just getting the weather for tomorrow.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.440
I was thinking of going shopping, and I don't want to get wet.

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:49.530
Get some clothes on, we're leaving.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:50.820
Where?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.190
I don't want to go.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:57.740
Just get moving!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:58.490
I-I understand.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.420
Don't worry, Boss.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:10.590
I can draw a handgun faster than Golgo.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.090
Billy,

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:16.430
kill Golgo 13 in front of Linda, please.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:18.600
You can count on me.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:37.410
He's coming out.

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.200
It's Billy!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.240
Get down!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.580
It's safe, Boss!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:56.510
Get back inside!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.750
Boss, get to the car!

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.670
Boss?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.220
Boss!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.100
D-Damn...

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.230
It was Golgo 13, wasn't it?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:48.690
Come on, Linda!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.560
No!

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:51.060
Hurry it up!

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:02.950
The top floor of the hotel on 78th street,

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.450
the room on the right, correct?

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.540
Got it.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:08.830
Detectives sure are handy.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:15.500
I knew Marty would die because of you one day.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:18.340
You were bad luck for him.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:24.720
But thanks to that, you can take over all his territory.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.060
Humans, you know,

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.640
have things they're good at, and things they aren't.

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:30.850
I'm not the type who could ever be a Boss,

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:36.570
just like you'll never be the young wife of a millionaire, no matter how much you wish you were.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.580
Get out.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.970
I knew it, you came for me!

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:44.260
I-If I hadn't been holding your arm,

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:47.350
I would've been able to draw faster than him.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:51.730
He's as good as they say.
He waited until I was at a disadvantage.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:21:00.940
At last, I'm not the low-class girl of a Mafia Boss.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.360
Now I can be a true pretty woman!

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:15.580
Where are you going?

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.880
You're going to Florida with me, right?

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.250
Wait a second!

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:20.800
Wait!

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:22.300
I said wait!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.850
Damn it...

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:30.810
I said wait!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:35.230
What don't you like about me?

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:37.310
Is it because I was a Mafia woman?

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.360
You're going to pay for that.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.110
A mere assassin, refusing me?

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.610
I hate you... I hate you!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:45.820
I hate you... I hate you!

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:09.140
Get out of my body...

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:11.390
That filthy blood...

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:17.480
All of it, get out of my body...

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:49.630
Chiisana koto ni zenryoku ni naru kimi no sugata yuuki ni natta hibi

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:49.630
Those days I saw you giving your all for small things filled me with courage

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:57.100
Zutto horyuu shippanashi jya ugokenai

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:57.100
If I keep them suspended then I won't be able to move

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:06.650
GARASU no HAIWEI ni tatteiru you ni

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:06.650
It's like I'm standing on a glass highway

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:13.870
Yume to kiken to senaka awase demo

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:13.870
Even if I'm standing back to back with dreams and danger

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:21.000
Kono nagai michi wo sukoshizutsu arukou

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:21.000
I'll take this long road one step at a time

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:27.170
Soshite kimi wa ano koro mitai ni

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:27.170
And I need you to smile

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.180
Waratteite

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:30.180
Like you did back then

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:36.810
Shiokaze ni yurete sasayakiatta

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:36.810
It shook in the sea breeze and whispered

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:47.400
Kagayaiteita tooi ano hi wa kagerou

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:47.400
That distant and shining day is a shimmering haze

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:49.280
The shining days

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:55.240
Tsumaranai koto ni makeru ni wa hayasugiru

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:55.240
I can't lose to something so trivial

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:03.540
Nikolavitch,

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:08.000
a former Olympic shooter who became an underworld assassin.

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:15.550
The threads of fate lead him and Golgo to a crossfire where they attempt to take out each other's clients.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:19.850
Their sniper duel will now begin!

00:24:19.850 --> 00:24:21.350
Next time on Golgo 13:

00:24:21.350 --> 00:24:24.480
The Superstar's Joint Appearance.

00:24:21.390 --> 00:24:27.230
The Superstar's Joint Appearance

00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:28.980
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
